    {
      "figure_id": "fig-choice-n37-quadratic-A",
      "source_number": "795",
      "authored_basis": "Deliberately reflected numeric pair: y=1.73x^2 heading draws -1.73x^2, and y=-14.8x^2 heading draws +14.8x^2. Actual y axes have ticks +/-5.19 and +/-44.4. Independent panel vertical units are 40/1.73 and 40/14.8 canvas units per y unit. x unit 72. Thus wrong coefficient signs, not hidden changed scales, produce the wrong orientations. Layout repair only: x tick labels are +/-1.5, y ticks are +/-3 vertical base units (numeric +/-5.19 or +/-44.4; normalized +/-3); Origin (0,0) is captioned below. All curve segment coordinates are unchanged.",
